        "title": "Public Life",
        "body": "Melania Trump was born Melanija Knavs in Novo Mesto, Slovenia, in 1970. She pursued an international modeling career and moved to New York in the 1990s. She became a United States citizen in 2006. As First Lady from 2017 to 2021 and again beginning in 2025, she has focused publicly on children’s well-being, online safety, foster youth, and White House preservation.",
